## Program Outcome

The hosted Tool Shed project page presents a privacy-bounded, per-instance lifecycle inventory and
artifact-specific recent history for Ideas, Maps, PRMs, and Campaigns. The implementation preserves
local authority, distinguishes document and outcome state, makes truncation and instance divergence
visible, avoids cadence-generated history, and refreshes through semantic SSE.

## M1-CONTRACT-AND-PERSISTENCE — Freeze and implement lifecycle projection truth

Status: active
Depends on: none

Outcome: Define and implement one backward-compatible reporter contract plus hosted persistence for
atomic per-instance snapshots and idempotent transition events.

Gates:

- `G1-LIFECYCLE-TRUTH-MODEL`: separate document lifecycle, outcome lifecycle, outcome disposition,
  and reconciliation; include all four first-class artifact types and preserve incomplete links.
- `G2-MULTI-INSTANCE-SNAPSHOT-AUTHORITY`: key snapshots to reporting instances, reject stale
  sequences, preserve source/freshness, and surface divergence without a synthetic merge.
- `G3-BOUNDED-DISCLOSURE-AND-RETENTION`: stable UUID/visible IDs, sanitized 160-character titles,
  allowlisted relationships, explicit total/truncation, bounded payloads, and 90-day transition
  retention pass contract, migration, ingestion, and privacy tests.

Candidate campaign: `implement-hosted-dashboard-work-lifecycle-and-history`.

## M2-PROJECT-EXPERIENCE-WORK2 — Work inventory, history, and live qualification

Status: active
Depends on: M1

Outcome: Render useful Work and History surfaces, derive complete-snapshot counts consistently,
qualify changed behavior, deploy the candidate to the configured combined Work2 target, and retain
its open owning chain for formal release.

Gate:

- `G4-HISTORY-FIDELITY-AND-LIVE-REFRESH`: first observation creates no invented historical
  transitions; only changed artifact fields create idempotent history; unchanged reports and
  heartbeats create none; accepted semantic changes advance SSE while receipt-only updates do not.

Candidate campaign: `implement-hosted-dashboard-work-lifecycle-and-history`.

