## Work2 Boundary

Work2 includes implementation, focused contract/ingestion/rendering/migration tests, the repository's
quick changed-path validation, a scoped product commit, deployment to the configured combined
`ts.rookaro.com` target, browser and API behavior checks, release-cohort registration, logical
checkpoint/rebuild proof, and strict Doctor.

Work2 does not push Git, tag or publish a Tool Shed version, synchronize disconnected installs, or
close IDEA-0012, MAP-0017, this PRM, or its owning campaign. Those remain awaiting formal Work5
release evidence and upward reconciliation.

## Deferred Scope

- Cross-project search and operator attention workflows from IDEA-0013 and IDEA-0015.
- Reporter/instance health extensions from IDEA-0014.
- Trends and bounded exports from IDEA-0016.
- Full historical reconstruction before the lifecycle contract existed.
